From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Maxim Stepanov <g.maxim.stepanoff@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 23 Jul 2026 01:05:19 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] rebase: v1.11.3 API adaptation + verify de-leak drift fixes

Remaining v1.10.3->v1.11.3 drift: acp_flavor threading, load_asset KeybindSource arg,
project/multi_workspace signature fixes, async-tungstenite unify (Cargo.lock), removed
shared-agent-thread open_listener branch, and verify de-leaks (rebranded doc URLs, Zed AI
-> Zedium AI, dropped forbidden strings in reliability/notifications/workspace_error/pier).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
